It lets me group responses by question, 
add notes, and record my scores. 

362
00:38:14,640 --> 00:38:17,760
The other interface helps me review 
entrants who also want to be considered  

363
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:21,920
for the researcher role that I'm hiring for.
The UI puts the applicant's essay right next  

364
00:38:21,920 --> 00:38:25,680
to their resume and their personal website 
so that I can see everything at once. 

365
00:38:25,680 --> 00:38:29,600
Cursor's harness is really good at helping 
