366
00:38:29,600 --> 00:38:33,840
I watched it render these interfaces in 
the built-in browser, take screenshots,  

367
00:38:33,840 --> 00:38:36,800
click through sections, and keep iterating.
At this point,  

368
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:40,320
Cursor is where I do most of my work.
Whether I'm reading and visualizing a bunch  

369
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:45,360
of research papers, or coding up an interface to 
review applications, or making flashcards for my  

370
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:50,480
blackboard lectures, Cursor just makes it very 
