It's up to them to determine that no  

457
00:48:03,920 --> 00:48:10,240
primitive is bigger than the clock cycle 
they're hoping a process node targets. 

458
00:48:10,240 --> 00:48:19,280
But other than that, can't you just take 
all the primitives from TSMC and keep adding  

459
00:48:19,280 --> 00:48:24,160
